        "en": "Doubao Proxy & Check-in",
        "zh": "豆包反代与每日签到"
      },
      "description": {
        "en": "Reverse-proxies the Doubao web models through your own logged-in desktop client (no password replay, no re-implemented a_bogus) and claims the daily quota check-in by clicking the real UI button. Tools: doubao_chat, doubao_checkin, doubao_status.",
